EmailTemplate.textOnly:
The last payment on your settlement agreement was returned as a stop pay. Please contact the bank to lift the stop pay or contact me as soon as possible to arrange for alternate payment. We will schedule the payment to re-run and if it does not clear you will be in default on your settlement agreement and we will be moving forward with enforcing the settlement agreement.  

I look forward to hearing from you.

Best Regards,

